WEBVTT

00:11:29.438 --> 00:11:31.186
and take their medications.

00:11:31.815 --> 00:11:33.459
Money can be a motivator.

00:11:34.176 --> 00:11:35.341
We all know that.

00:11:35.365 --> 00:11:39.937
But it's far more influential
when it's paired with psychology.

00:11:40.728 --> 00:11:43.018
And money, of course,
has its own disadvantages.

00:11:43.042 --> 00:11:46.599
My favorite example of this
involves a daycare program.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:51.906
The greatest sin you can commit in daycare
is picking up your kids late.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:53.874
No one is happy.

00:11:53.898 --> 00:11:56.261
Your kids are crying
because you don't love them.

00:11:56.285 --> 00:11:57.451
(Laughter)

00:11:57.475 --> 00:12:00.138
The teachers are unhappy
because they leave work late.